      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Expert Enchanter Byrnes adds special enchants to the [ITEM:2981|Heroic Ring]."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "For each slot you first choose an enchant category; one of the options in that category is then given, each with equal chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "How It Works",
      "anchor": "process"
    },
