          "1 of the 5 options of the chosen category, each with equal chance"
        ],
        [
          "Failure / Destruction",
          "None"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Equipped Rings Only",
      "text": "The Heroic Ring can only be enchanted while it is equipped in the left or right accessory slot."
